  "provenance": {
    "source_notes": "Reference for this template's layout, text, and colors came from a clean, isolated plate texture the Forza Writer user supplied -- one of a set of thirteen originally extracted from GTA V's companion iFruit app (not this app's own game files, and not a screenshot taken in-game) and posted publicly to Reddit by u/sgtfrankieboy. The app's government-exempt plate: an off-white background, no month or registration-detail stickers (neither is visible on this specific texture, unlike the standard San Andreas variants), and 'SA EXEMPT' in bold dark red block capitals (color approximately #BB2020, sampled) centered in the upper third. The lower area is blank in the reference texture (filled in dynamically per-vehicle), same as every other GTA template here -- modeled as an ordinary registration field even though a real EXEMPT plate likely carries a different kind of identifier; nothing in the reference distinguishes the two, so the standard field/format is reused rather than guessed at.",
